<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Payment Failed — ENG Sports</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #3b1f1f 50%, #1f0f0f 100%);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 56px 48px;
      max-width: 520px;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }

    .error-icon {
      width: 90px;
      height: 90px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ef4444, #b91c1c);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 0 auto 32px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);
      animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4); }
      50% { box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.7); }
    }

    .error-icon svg {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      stroke: #ffffff;
      stroke-width: 3;
      fill: none;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      stroke-linejoin: round;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);
      color: #f87171;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      border-radius: 100px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    p.subtitle {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }

    .info-box {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .info-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 8px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    }

    .info-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .info-label {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .info-value {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .info-value.red {
      color: #f87171;
    }

    .error-detail {
      background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .btn-group {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ef4444, #b91c1c);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.35);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.5);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .footer-text {
      margin-top: 28px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .logo {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }

    .logo span {
      color: #ef4444;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="logo">ENG <span>Sports</span> Events</div>

    <div class="error-icon">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line>
        <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="badge">Payment Failed</div>

    <h1>Your Payment Was Not Processed</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
      Unfortunately, your payment could not be completed. This may have happened due to a declined card, insufficient funds, or a network issue. No charges have been made.
    </p>

    <div class="info-box">
      <div class="info-row">
        <span class="info-label">Status</span>
        <span class="info-value red">✗ Failed</span>
      </div>
      <div class="info-row">
        <span class="info-label">Reason</span>
        <span class="info-value"><%= errorMessage || 'Payment was cancelled or failed' %></span>
      </div>
      <div class="info-row">
        <span class="info-label">Date</span>
        <span class="info-value"><%= date %></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="error-detail">
      <strong style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);">What to do next:</strong><br/>
      Please check your card details and try again. If the problem persists, contact your bank or reach out to our support team for assistance.
    </div>

    <p class="footer-text">
      No charges were made to your account.<br />
      ENG Sports Events © <%= year %>
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
